{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T04:07:08.002Z","ordinal":323532,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016add8069e96081a09acf081364881d54","status":"completed","call_id":"call_8a0f4bbe2bd4421aaf95ce74e877f197","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"git push -u origin v1/plan-07-installer-attestation-fix && gh pr create --base main --head v1/plan-07-installer-attestation-fix --title \\\"Fix installer attestation fail-closed behavior\\\" --body \\\"## Summary\\n- Fail before download when `NEXUS_VERIFY_ATTESTATION=1` but no trusted GitHub CLI exists at `/usr/bin/gh` or `/usr/local/bin/gh`.\\n- Invoke attestation verification only through those fixed absolute paths, never through caller-controlled `PATH`.\\n- Extend installer smoke coverage for missing trusted `gh`, a successful PATH shim, and successful verification of both the archive and checksum index through a controlled trusted-path fixture.\\n\\n## Validation\\n- Independent source review: ACCEPT on the exact patch.\\n- `sh -n install.sh`, `bash -n scripts/installer-smoke.sh`, and `git diff --check` pass.\\n- Local behavioral tests are deferred while another live full-suite run holds the repository `SUITE` claim. The PR's exact-head CI will run on isolated GitHub runners.\\n\\nBase: `a3e1b65a36b4c64f44e5def6500214d1b256d4be`\\nCandidate: `c5329103168fb1dfcf8438ccc3f8bd21312f5419`\\\"\",\"workdir\":\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/plan-07-installer-attestation-fix\",\"yield_time_ms\":10000,\"max_output_tokens\":800}); text(r.output);","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1713d-0b2a-7db2-90f2-c2a36ce893bb","create_time":1792901225.933921}}}
