{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T04:23:49.035Z","ordinal":323941,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"task_complete","root_turn_id":"01a17148-fc5b-75c0-b566-14fe4799c247","turn_id":"01a17148-fc5b-75c0-b566-14fe4799c247","last_agent_message":"Fresh checks confirm PR #211 is still on exact head `c532910` against unchanged `origin/main` `a3e1b65`. CodeQL and JS/TS passed; Node 22 and 24 full tests remain in progress. Current-main CI is also in progress, with CodeQL passed.\n\nThe local full-suite runner is live in its second isolated snapshot. I left its `SUITE` claim untouched and ran no competing local tests. Issue #1 still has no custodian response; the latest public release remains RC4, with no exact-RC acceptance or stable release established.\n\nThe fix remains in PR #211; merge and later release gates are still pending.","started_at":1792901971,"completed_at":1792902229,"duration_ms":257987,"time_to_first_token_ms":2391}}
