{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T04:51:31.676Z","ordinal":324498,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17166-29c6-7782-8ecb-9326d4f90716","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-7c843128-b5ed-4102-bf3f-b90a348ee01b","server":"mcp-search","tool":"work_state_read","arguments":{"includeClosed":true},"pluginId":"claude-mem@claude-mem-local","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"- nexus-v1-release: pr133_ci=Node20/22/24 and CodeQL passed exact head; Linux packaging run 39665020828 active, pr133_head=6f522952bb50d956f259068b0a34151f614c956a, next=Continue monitoring live Node22/24 results. When PR checks complete, review exact Linux package/installer-smoke result and recheck base. Integrate only if all required exact-head checks pass; then verify post-merge main CI/CodeQL., current_main=Remote origin/main verified 19b30a4c92b8dd2c891c5b7a5b67db319ee9ee7f after PR208 merge. CI40152020819 exact head: Node22/24 success; Linux job 121048490157 currently in cargo release build, so full CI not yet terminal., sbom=PR134 merged as 049880f; exact PR CI39679493728 all4 SUCCESS, CodeQL39679493753 SUCCESS, focused SBOM closure tests 10/10 PASS, independent ACCEPT; post-merge main gates pass, active_claims=Release publisher remains active; SUITE now released after exact main CI and CodeQL terminal success; no other local test started, blocking_decision=RC2 Node floor: awaiting user's choice between DEC-12 >=20 with EOL disclosure and newer reported no-EOL mandate >=22, pr126_status=Merged 2026-10-21T23:16:39Z as f8ba4c1248d400ac321aec1d08b74437a1c8d70b after exact-head CI run39688533586 all four success and CodeQL39688533646 success. Postmerge main CI39692357597 and CodeQL39692357575 in progress. PR127/128 old checks are stale because base ffad03f; must refresh/requalify serially. PR135 CI active on previous main 049880f; refresh after terminal., pr135_status=Exact h