{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T04:52:14.361Z","ordinal":324526,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17166-29c6-7782-8ecb-9326d4f90716","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-775917de-b2d8-422e-b3af-491566359761","process_id":"23484","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh pr view 207 --json number,title,state,headRefOid,baseRefOid,mergeStateStatus,reviewDecision,statusCheckRollup,url,body && gh pr view 200 --json number,title,state,headRefOid,baseRefOid,mergeStateStatus,reviewDecision,statusCheckRollup,url,body && for f in .git/nexus-claims/*/owner.json; do jq -r 'select((.pr|tostring)==\"207\" or (.pr|tostring)==\"200\") | input_filename + \" \" + (.agent//\"\") + \" \" + (.status//\"\") + \" \" + (.head//\"\")' \"$f\"; done"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/plan-07-installer-attestation-fix","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh pr view 207 --json number,title,state,headRefOid,baseRefOid,mergeStateStatus,reviewDecision,statusCheckRollup,url,body && gh pr view 200 --json number,title,state,headRefOid,baseRefOid,mergeStateStatus,reviewDecision,statusCheckRollup,url,body && for f in .git/nexus-claims/*/owner.json; do jq -r 'select((.pr|tostring)==\"207\" or (.pr|tostring)==\"200\") | input_filename + \" \" + (.agent//\"\") + \" \" + (.status//\"\") + \" \" + (.head//\"\")' \"$f\"; done"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"failed","aggregated_output":"{\"baseRefOid\":\"19b30a4c92b8dd2c891c5b7a5b67db319ee9ee7f\",\"body\":\"## Summary\\n\\nThis is a no-force, current-main replacement candidate for the fail-closed Nexus state exclusion and verified filesystem cleanup work in PR #200. It is based on `main` at `c1b13327edf5d3a0c82fb10eb814775fd4953a63`; the candidate head is `8e5fc70f9423b6e5b889aad249b4f2b9a0479a4e`.\\n\\nThe existing PR #200 remains open so its history and old-head evidence are preserved. Its head is stale, and its hosted Node 22/24 jobs have remained in `npm test` without a conclusion since 2026-10-24 20:38Z. Those jobs are not counted as passing evidence. This PR should be reviewed and checked on its exact head before deciding whether to close or supersede #200.\\n\\n## Validation on an isolated snapshot\\n\\n- `git_exclude.test.ts` + `flight_exclude.test.ts`: 21/21 passed.\\n- The two `doctor.test.ts` safe-filesystem race regressions: 2/2 passed after correcting the ESM built-in test hooks with `syncBuiltinESMExports()`.\\n- TypeScript `--noEmit`: passed.\\n- `git diff --check`: passed.\\n- The full suite was not run. A broader doctor test invocation without the packaged build prerequisites was inconclusive and is recorded as such.\\n\\nPlease perform an independent review of this exact candidate and run the required exact-head CI. No acceptance or release qualification is claimed by this PR.\\n\",\"headRefOid\":\"f6f2c152975d158557513db2d9d29141f5c8a60a\",\"mergeStateStatus\":\"BLOCKED\",\"number\":207,\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"statusCheckRollup\":[{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-25T02:31:13Z\",\"conclusion\":\"CANCELLED\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40154385463/job/121052507140\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (22)\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-25T02:25:30Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"CI\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-25T02:26:27Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40154385584/job/121052507694\",\"name\":\"javascript-typescript\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-25T02:25:30Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"CodeQL\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-25T02:31:13Z\",\"conclusion\":\"CANCELLED\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40154385463/job/121052507277\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (24)\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-25T02:25:30Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"CI\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-25T02:26:20Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/runs/121052668136\",\"name\":\"CodeQL\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-25T02:26:18Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"\"},{\"__typename\":\"StatusContext\",\"context\":\"CodeRabbit\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-25T02:25:34Z\",\"state\":\"SUCCESS\",\"targetUrl\":\"\"}],\"title\":\"fix(git): safely exclude Nexus workspace state\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/207\"}\n{\"baseRefOid\":\"29eab4cd58051a8210b5ef66e0c9e248b2046a13\",\"body\":\"## Summary\\n\\n- Keep `.nexus/` exclusion fail-closed when Git still considers protected Nexus state visible.\\n- Avoid appending duplicate rules on every retry when a higher-priority repository ignore rule defeats `info/exclude`.\\n- Append a final positive rule when a later negation in `info/exclude` can be overridden.\\n- Defer exclusion-file mutation from `WorktreeManager` construction until a worktree is actually created.\\n- Apply the self-ignore at the repository root, where Nexus stores worktrees, even when the selected workspace is a subdirectory.\\n- Reject unsafe `.nexus` ignore targets and add regressions for negation, symlink/hard-link paths, unavailable Git metadata, and nested workspaces.\\n- Make `writeExclusiveVerified` and `mkdirVerified` leave raced entries untouched after failed verification, avoiding path-based cleanup that could delete a replacement. Their contents are not written before verification.\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- Focused Git exclusion tests: 11/11 passed on implementation commit `5068bcf` with isolated `HOME` and `XDG_CONFIG_HOME` (historical; predates the new race regressions).\\n- Focused flight/worktree tests: 6/6 passed on implementation commit `5068bcf` with isolated `HOME` and `XDG_CONFIG_HOME` (historical).\\n- `tsc --noEmit`: passed on commit `81928bd` with isolated `HOME` and `XDG_CONFIG_HOME`.\\n- `git diff --check`: passed on exact PR diff.\\n- Independent read-only review: ACCEPT on exact PR diff SHA-256 `3bd2245f532151c94bac0ebf71ede8706d0609598f8b94e9cdee6ed640fa42b8`.\\n- Exact-head CI run `40130531444` and CodeQL run `40130531552` are in progress. A full local suite is also active on a separate immutable snapshot; no overlapping local test has been started.\\n\\n## Base\\n\\n- `main` at `29eab4cd58051a8210b5ef66e0c9e248b2046a13`.\\n\",\"headRefOid\":\"81928bd81d10ec957a3063a0e414aef981c83b20\",\"mergeStateStatus\":\"BLOCKED\",\"number\":200,\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"statusCheckRollup\":[{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-25T02:37:07Z\",\"conclusion\":\"CANCELLED\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40130531444/job/120981094860\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (22)\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-24T20:36:26Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"CI\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-24T20:38:03Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40130531552/job/120981094972\",\"name\":\"javascript-typescript\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-24T20:36:27Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"CodeQL\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-25T02:37:01Z\",\"conclusion\":\"CANCELLED\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40130531444/job/120981094683\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (24)\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-24T20:36:27Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"CI\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-25T02:37:07Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SKIPPED\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40130531444/job/121054795410\",\"name\":\"linux-x86_64\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-25T02:37:08Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"CI\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-24T20:37:56Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/runs/120981427339\",\"name\":\"CodeQL\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-24T20:37:53Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"\"},{\"__typename\":\"StatusContext\",\"context\":\"CodeRabbit\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-24T20:36:28Z\",\"state\":\"SUCCESS\",\"targetUrl\":\"\"}],\"title\":\"fix(git): avoid duplicate ineffective exclusion rules\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/200\"}\nzsh:1: no matches found: .git/nexus-claims/*/owner.json\n","exit_code":1,"duration":{"secs":2,"nanos":382460873}},"started_at_ms":1792903931978,"completed_at_ms":1792903934361}}
