ling source/CI, RC3 E5 evidence, held-out custody, and Ubuntu terminal setup; preserve historical snapshots and do not claim acceptance.\",\n  \"head\": \"worktree diff in /home/mike/nexus-wt/readiness-rc4-refresh; base be2cd2f; uncommitted addition preserved\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-24T20:58:00Z\",\n  \"independent_review\": \"PENDING current full added diff\",\n  \"status\": \"Current exact main snapshot appended at 29eab4c; exact CI 40123199081 and CodeQL 40123199130 pass; clean detached requirements --enforce passes with 12 explicit RC deferrals; RC4 public but predates current main. Desktop preflight recorded in Issue #3 comment 6389426338; manual matrix 0/15. Full added checkpoint under independent review.\",\n  \"reviewed_candidate\": null,\n  \"reviewer\": \"plan05_readonly_review\",\n  \"reviewed_at\": null,\n  \"review_note\": \"Prior snapshot review ACCEPT is historical; independent review requested for full current added checkpoint.\",\n  \"pushed_candidate\": \"4b2e7ccebf0520f5ec7849ade2c2bf3c0559a2b0\",\n  \"reviewed_diff_sha256\": null\n}\n{\n  \"agent\": \"/root\",\n  \"host\": \"mike-dev\",\n  \"branch\": \"v1/rc5-version-sync\",\n  \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc5-version-sync\",\n  \"base\": \"29eab4cd58051a8210b5ef66e0c9e248b2046a13\",\n  \"since\": \"2026-10-23T08:21:16Z\",\n  \"scope\": \"Release coordination and versioning/RC lifecycle preparation; preserve exact-source, installed-RC, independent and human acceptance gates.\",\n  \"status\": \"origin/main 29eab4c exact CI 40123199081 and CodeQL 40123199130 pass; requirements --enforce passed on exact source. PR200 a568a0d remains open with independent ACCEPT and CodeQL pass; Node22/24 full-suite CI 40123934735 still in progress. Local suite process group 361053 is live in defect-doctor-state-dir-snapshot; no overlap or takeover. Ubuntu desktop 10.0.8.3 reachable; terminal versions captured and clean procedure checkout staged at ~/nexus-terminal-acceptance-setup pinned to 29eab4c;