timate, but explicitly labels it historical and says it predates the nine-class correction; it is not an execution denominator.\\\\n\\\\nThis resolves the planning-text discrepancy only. T4 qualification has not run \\\",\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-22T22:47:41Z\\\"},\\\"number\\\":2,\\\"state\\\":\\\"OPEN\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"PLAN-10 task 11: complete preregistered M5 qualification runs\\\",\\\"updatedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-22T22:47:41Z\\\"}\\n\"}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"id\":3,\"chunk_id\":\"02476f\",\"wall_time_seconds\":1.564431876,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":206,\"output\":\"{\\\"latest\\\":{\\\"author\\\":\\\"mikeholownych\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"### Terminal environment preflight (setup only; no qualification cells run)\\\\n\\\\nThe connected Ubuntu 26.04 GNOME desktop is reachable and has an active local GNOME/Wayland session. All required terminal applications are installed: xterm XTerm(407), kitty 0.45.0, GNOME Terminal 3.58.0, tmux 3.6, and VS Code 1.143.1. The `nexus` command is not installed on that host yet.\\\\n\\\\nThe matrix remains 0/15. Each cell still requires the real interactive checks in ACCEPTANCE.md §5.3 and two screenshots (approval panel and post-exit terminal state). Current public RC4 is not the current source head: its commit i\\\",\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-24T20:55:35Z\\\"},\\\"number\\\":3,\\\"state\\\":\\\"OPEN\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"PLAN-10 task 12: complete the real-terminal acceptance matrix\\\",\\\"updatedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-24T20:55:35Z\\\"}\\n\"}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"id\":5,\"chunk_id\":\"7d328b\",\"wall_time_seconds\":1.536440609,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":174,\"output\":\"{\\\"latest\\\":{\\\"author\\\":\\\"mikeholownych\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"Status check at `6a16cb6` (claude-code): the workflow is integrated. `.github/workflows/repro.yml` plus `scripts/repro-identity.mjs` (PR #20) build on ubuntu-22.04 and 24.04 with fail-closed tag/commit/clean-tree/version identity. It has **not** run on an RC because no RC tag exists yet. REQ-REL-114 is still `RR`, correctly. Next action: once the RC is tagged, the release publisher (codex-api-root) runs repro.yml on the exact RC and attaches the run ID and artifact hashes here.\\\",\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-18T17:34:28Z\\\"},\\\"number\\\":5,\\\"state\\\":\\\"OPEN\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"PLAN-07 PR-7e: prove cross-runner release reproducibility\\\",\\\"updatedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-18T17:34:28Z\\\"}\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1716d-4ef9-7030-a040-e096bc518776","create_time":1792904371.328359}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
