{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T05:00:17.757Z","ordinal":324929,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1716d-4ef9-7030-a040-e096bc518776","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-baf177f8-b680-439f-8be5-211c5ea19657","process_id":"41223","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh pr view 207 --json comments --jq '.comments[-4:][]|{author:.author.login,createdAt,body:(.body|.[0:800])}' && git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/git-exclude-fail-closed log -1 --format='%H %cI %s' && ssh -o BatchMode=yes -o ConnectTimeout=5 mike@10.0.8.3 'command -v nexus || true'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/plan-07-installer-attestation-fix","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh pr view 207 --json comments --jq '.comments[-4:][]|{author:.author.login,createdAt,body:(.body|.[0:800])}' && git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/git-exclude-fail-closed log -1 --format='%H %cI %s' && ssh -o BatchMode=yes -o ConnectTimeout=5 mike@10.0.8.3 'command -v nexus || true'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"### Independent Review: ACCEPT\\n\\n- **Target Commit**: `8e5fc70f9423b6e5b889aad249b4f2b9a0479a4e`\\n- **Base Commit**: `c1b13327edf5d3a0c82fb10eb814775fd4953a63` (`origin/main`)\\n- **Diff SHA256**: `67681eea9ace5bc2e3b19fbab55375163470b611387e4be67c8053ad9464cb7b`\\n\\n#### Summary \\u0026 Verification\\n1. **Nexus State Exclude \\u0026 Safe Filesystem Hardening**:\\n   - Defers and restricts workspace exclusion writes until needed, ensuring idempotent updates that preserve existing rules.\\n   - Hardens `.nexus/` against higher-priority repository ignore negations via a nested self-ignore (`.nexus/.gitignore`) with trailing `*` catch-all.\\n   - Refuses directory traversal, outside path redirection, symlinked/hard-linked exclude targets, and descriptor verification races.\\n   - Replaces unmockable ESM namespace assign\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-24T23:43:17Z\"}\n{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"**Independent review (claude-code) at exact head `8e5fc70f9423b6e5b889aad249b4f2b9a0479a4e` (base `c1b1332`): ACCEPT.**\\n\\nThis is #200 as I accepted it at `81928bd` (self-ignoring `.nexus/.gitignore`, lazy `WorktreeManager` check, verified creation), rebased onto current main, plus two new commits:\\n- **`473103d` guard info exclude updates.** `info/exclude` is updated only when `--git-path info/exclude` resolves to `\\u003crealpath(--git-common-dir)\\u003e/info/exclude`. It's opened with O_NOFOLLOW and O_APPEND, must be a regular file with nlink==1, and its `/proc/self/fd` path must match. If it's missing, it's created with `writeExclusiveVerified`. All of this stays inside the best-effort block.\\n- **`8e5fc70`** is test-only: race-hook synchronisation.\\n\\nI re-ran my tsx repro at this head on fresh repos:\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-25T00:27:49Z\"}\n{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"### Independent Review: ACCEPT\\n\\n- **Target Commit**: `f6f2c152975d158557513db2d9d29141f5c8a60a`\\n- **Base Commit**: `19b30a4c92b8dd2c891c5b7a5b67db319ee9ee7f` (`origin/main`)\\n- **Diff SHA256**: `55b0230bcdb125cecc263c83afbb83dc9bc54cab24ca557209a92f57d503de7a`\\n\\n#### Summary \\u0026 Verification\\n1. **Rebase \\u0026 Concurrency Invariants**:\\n   - Rebased cleanly onto current `origin/main` (`19b30a4`).\\n   - Clean 3-way merge (`6ef7775a43e7617c1c0d6a6d3b66e8e5ec47cc28`) with 0 whitespace errors (`git diff --check` passed).\\n2. **Worktree Metadata Fail-Closed Verification**:\\n   - Implements `hasGitMarkerInAncestors(workspace)`, ensuring that when Git metadata is unavailable within any parent Git repository or linked worktree, `ensureGitExclude` refuses to proceed and aborts before creating or writing to `.ne\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-25T02:26:53Z\"}\n{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"**Re-review (claude-code) at exact head `f6f2c152975d158557513db2d9d29141f5c8a60a` (base `19b30a4`): ACCEPT.** `git range-diff` shows commits 1–10 unchanged from `8e5fc70`, which I accepted, so my five-case repro still holds.\\n\\nThe new `f6f2c15` fails closed when `git rev-parse --git-path` fails but a `.git` marker exists in an ancestor, so state isn't written into a worktree whose ignore status can't be verified. That's correct. It can only fire at actual `.nexus` write points: `FlightRecorder` is opt-in via `--flight` or `recordFlight` (default false, config.ts:266), and `WorktreeManager` runs the check only right before it creates a worktree. A normal startup isn't affected, and a non-git workspace with no ancestor `.git` still returns early.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-25T02:51:28Z\"}\n3a5fc8eb745d2dbb7f76a5201038a7c0973ecd3d 2026-10-25T04:01:13+00:00 fix(git): fail closed when worktree metadata is unavailable\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":2,"nanos":182608673}},"started_at_ms":1792904415574,"completed_at_ms":1792904417757}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T05:00:19.224Z","ordinal":324930,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a1716e-5798-7592-8d6c-dfccf41437e7","call_id":"call_750939aa048e49f4a93f2faecf9c0f39","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 5.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"### Independent Review: ACCEPT\\n\\n- **Target Commit**: `8e5fc70f9423b6e5b889aad249b4f2b9a0479a4e`\\n- **Base Commit**: `c1b13327edf5d3a0c82fb10eb814775fd4953a63` (`origin/main`)\\n- **Diff SHA256**: `67681eea9ace5bc2e3b19fbab55375163470b611387e4be67c8053ad9464cb7b`\\n\\n#### Summary \\u0026 Verification\\n1. **Nexus State Exclude \\u0026 Safe Filesystem Hardening**:\\n   - Defers and restricts workspace exclusion writes until needed, ensuring idempotent updates that preserve existing rules.\\n   - Hardens `.nexus/` against higher-priority repository ignore negations via a nested self-ignore (`.nexus/.gitignore`) with trailing `*` catch-all.\\n   - Refuses directory traversal, outside path redirection, symlinked/hard-linked exclude targets, and descriptor verification races.\\n   - Replaces unmockable ESM namespace assign\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-24T23:43:17Z\"}\n{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"**Independent review (claude-code) at exact head `8e5fc70f9423b6e5b889aad249b4f2b9a0479a4e` (base `c1b1332`): ACCEPT.**\\n\\nThis is #200 as I accepted it at `81928bd` (self-ignoring `.nexus/.gitignore`, lazy `WorktreeManager` check, verified creation), rebased onto current main, plus two new commits:\\n- **`473103d` guard info exclude updates.** `info/exclude` is updated only when `--git-path info/exclude` resolves to `\\u003crealpath(--git-common-dir)\\u003e/info/exclude`. It's opened with O_NOFOLLOW and O_APPEND, must be a regular file with nlink==1, and its `/proc/self/fd` path must match. If it's missing, it's created with `writeExclusiveVerified`. All of this stays inside the best-effort block.\\n- **`8e5fc70`** is test-only: race-hook synchronisation.\\n\\nI re-ran my tsx repro at this head on fresh repos:\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-25T00:27:49Z\"}\n{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"### Independent Review: ACCEPT\\n\\n- **Target Commit**: `f6f2c152975d158557513db2d9d29141f5c8a60a`\\n- **Base Commit**: `19b30a4c92b8dd2c891c5b7a5b67db319ee9ee7f` (`origin/main`)\\n- **Diff SHA256**: `55b0230bcdb125cecc263c83afbb83dc9bc54cab24ca557209a92f57d503de7a`\\n\\n#### Summary \\u0026 Verification\\n1. **Rebase \\u0026 Concurrency Invariants**:\\n   - Rebased cleanly onto current `origin/main` (`19b30a4`).\\n   - Clean 3-way merge (`6ef7775a43e7617c1c0d6a6d3b66e8e5ec47cc28`) with 0 whitespace errors (`git diff --check` passed).\\n2. **Worktree Metadata Fail-Closed Verification**:\\n   - Implements `hasGitMarkerInAncestors(workspace)`, ensuring that when Git metadata is unavailable within any parent Git repository or linked worktree, `ensureGitExclude` refuses to proceed and aborts before creating or writing to `.ne\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-25T02:26:53Z\"}\n{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"**Re-review (claude-code) at exact head `f6f2c152975d158557513db2d9d29141f5c8a60a` (base `19b30a4`): ACCEPT.** `git range-diff` shows commits 1–10 unchanged from `8e5fc70`, which I accepted, so my five-case repro still holds.\\n\\nThe new `f6f2c15` fails closed when `git rev-parse --git-path` fails but a `.git` marker exists in an ancestor, so state isn't written into a worktree whose ignore status can't be verified. That's correct. It can only fire at actual `.nexus` write points: `FlightRecorder` is opt-in via `--flight` or `recordFlight` (default false, config.ts:266), and `WorktreeManager` runs the check only right before it creates a worktree. A normal startup isn't affected, and a non-git workspace with no ancestor `.git` still returns early.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-25T02:51:28Z\"}\n3a5fc8eb745d2dbb7f76a5201038a7c0973ecd3d 2026-10-25T04:01:13+00:00 fix(git): fail closed when worktree metadata is unavailable\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1716d-4ef9-7030-a040-e096bc518776","create_time":1792904419.2243176}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
