{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T05:07:56.595Z","ordinal":325109,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1716d-4ef9-7030-a040-e096bc518776","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016add8ea9e76881a0a3f66bc6dc947294","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"**NEXUS_V1_CONVERGENCE_ACTIVE — acceptance IN_PROGRESS**\n\n- PR #211’s corrected head is `8faf36aa43e9f74b823e68233f37180e68ff5cdb`. Independent review and CodeQL passed; Node 22 CI passed, while Node 24 is still running. The Linux package job has not finished.\n- Main CI on `a3e1b65a36b4c64f44e5def6500214d1b256d4be` is also still running its Node 22 retry after GitHub reported runner communication loss. Node 24 and CodeQL passed. I’m not treating the interrupted attempt as a product test failure.\n- The Ubuntu/GNOME terminal host is prepared, including GitHub CLI 2.103.2 from the official signed APT repository; its provenance-verification command is available. The repository’s official instructions publish the signing-key fingerprints and APT setup procedure. [GitHub CLI Linux installation instructions](https://github.com/cli/cli/blob/trunk/docs/install_linux.md). I recorded the setup on [Issue #3](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/3#issuecomment-6393710614). The human matrix remains **0/15** until a current RC is installed and each cell is run with its required screenshots.\n- Your “default to review” choice is reflected in current `main`; RC4 predates that behavior. Held-out custody is still unanswered, so qualification and stable release remain gated.\n\nNo local tests were started while the full-suite claim was active."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1792904873931,"completed_at_ms":1792904876595}}
