{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T05:29:07.550Z","ordinal":325812,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17185-69c7-7a00-a545-17e664227aaf","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016add93a34c0081a0bf3f1b9adda1fd42","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The trust screen and the “approvals use permission settings” separation are already present on exact `origin/main` at `a3e1b65`; the associated startup tests and DEC-01 amendment are also there. That means the reported missing screen is likely a gap between current source and the installed RC, which still needs exact-RC installation evidence. PR #211’s Linux job is building the package now; the main retry’s Linux suite remains active."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1792906147325,"completed_at_ms":1792906147550}}
