{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T05:30:19.656Z","ordinal":325843,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"task_complete","root_turn_id":"01a17185-69c7-7a00-a545-17e664227aaf","turn_id":"01a17185-69c7-7a00-a545-17e664227aaf","last_agent_message":"`origin/main` remains at `a3e1b65a36b4c64f44e5def6500214d1b256d4be`. It already contains the startup folder-trust prompt, the separation from tool approvals, and `review` as the unset default. Exact-RC installed behavior is still unverified.\n\nFor PR #211 (`8faf36a`), Node 22/24, CodeQL, and the Linux CLI suite passed. Linux packaging passed its first build and is now running the reproducibility build; final comparisons and smoke checks remain pending. Main CI’s Linux suite is also still running. I recorded the latest PR progress in the claims log.\n\nI left the dirty shared checkout unchanged and started no overlapping suite. Acceptance remains **IN_PROGRESS**; no accepted RC or completed release is claimed.","started_at":1792905931,"completed_at":1792906219,"duration_ms":288437,"time_to_first_token_ms":1660}}
