answered; acceptance IN_PROGRESS.\n2026-10-25T04:58:32Z MAIN_CI_RETRY_PROGRESS: Exact main CI run40160250252 retry attempt2 is active as job121080001798 on a3e1b65; the Node22 job has reached `npm --prefix cli test` after build and earlier gates passed. Attempt1 ended with GitHub runner communication failure, not a test result. Node24 and CodeQL are already SUCCESS on the same SHA. PR211 run40163351990 remains active on exact head8faf36a in Node22/24 CLI test steps; CodeQL40163351953 SUCCESS. No local tests run under active SUITE.\n2026-10-25T05:00:00Z TERMINAL_HOST_SETUP: Connected Ubuntu26.04 GNOME host has xterm407, kitty0.45.0, GNOME Terminal3.58.0, tmux3.6, VS Code1.143.1. Replaced obsolete distro gh2.46 package with official signed GitHub CLI apt package gh2.103.2 after validating official keyring SHA-256 and signing fingerprint; `/usr/bin/gh attestation verify` is available. Updated Issue3 with setup-only status. No Nexus RC installed, no cells run, matrix remains 0/15.\n2026-10-25T05:06:26Z PR211_CI_PROGRESS: Exact head8faf36aa43e9f74b823e68233f37180e68ff5cdb remains on basea3e1b65. CI40163351990 Node22 job121079312171 SUCCESS; Node24 job121079311948 still running npm CLI tests. CodeQL40163351953 SUCCESS; source review ACCEPT. Main CI40160250252 retry attempt2 Node22 job121080001798 still running npm CLI tests; Node24 and CodeQL passed on a3e1b65. No local test execution under active SUITE.\n2026-10-25T05:13:00Z PR211_NODE_MATRIX_GREEN: Exact PR #211 head8faf36a Node22 and Node24 test-matrix both SUCCESS; CodeQL40163351953 and JavaScript/TypeScript also SUCCESS. linux-x86_64 package/repro/install smoke job is now running. Main CI rerun attempt2 remains IN_PROGRESS Node22; Node24 SUCCESS. Local SUITE unresolved with Kimi owner process live; no local tests.\n2026-10-25T05:10:00Z PR211_MATRIX_PASS_LINUX_STARTED: Exact PR211 head8faf36a Node22 job121079312171 SUCCESS and Node24 job121079311948 SUCCESS; CodeQL40163351953 SUCCESS; Linux packaging job121082436038 s