{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T05:46:44.739Z","ordinal":326608,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a17198-d883-7f01-a102-8e93f168508b","author":"/root/current_main_rc_path_audit","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/current_main_rc_path_audit\nPayload:\n**ACCEPT.** The worksheet excludes RC4 for the correct DEC-01 behavior mismatch and leaves next-RC identity fields blank. Its install instructions require attestation and use a version-scoped prefix. The desktop inventory matches current read-only checks; kitty protocol verification remains explicitly required at runtime. All 15 cells and screenshot requirements remain, with no results claimed.\n\nRead-only review; no tests were run."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17189-d092-7ab1-ba2e-16c982c7dc3c","create_time":1792907204.7394464}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":16423}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T05:46:47.563Z","ordinal":326609,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016add97c73b7081a0b2fcbcfb218d9be3","status":"completed","call_id":"call_dffb8a86d37b486c8e7c933ce5b8d21a","name":"exec","input":"const hits = ALL_TOOLS.filter(x => /work_state_(read|write)|github.*(pull|workflow|check)|agent.*mail/i.test(x.name+\" \"+x.description));\ntext(hits);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17189-d092-7ab1-ba2e-16c982c7dc3c","create_time":1792907207.2340205}}}
