urrent-batch fix underway; not yet tested., doctor_d1b_pr=PR #155 opened at https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/155; head 76b34f1d18d766b06011176a85679e7c3434ba30, base 382e0182795ad08332c30a7f798b94c525f8f068. Independent review ACCEPT. Focused doctor tests 5/5 and tsc --noEmit pass. Exact PR CI run39893335185 and CodeQL39893335167 in progress. No merge yet., main_latest_ci=Run39891501513 exact main 382e018: Node22 and Node24 full suites SUCCESS; Linux package job still in progress. CodeQL39891501527 SUCCESS. Prior PR153 post-merge run39891244410 on 429bd314 remains historical and Linux packaging in progress; not needed to combine with current-main evidence., custody_refresh=Issue #1 last updated 2026-10-22T22:08:35Z. No custodian response; 40-task manifest custody acceptance and compatibility remain external blocker. No held-out content accessed; no qualification started., doctor_broad_test=Full doctor.test.ts local run attempted after npm ci; 33 pass, 8 fail due missing built CLI/core artifacts in fresh worktree (e.g.\\n[Response shortened; request fewer selected records for more detail.]\"}]},\"claims\":\"{\\\"conclusion\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"headSha\\\":\\\"016bbc332d694b32072f6346e7f3127fb98b691f\\\",\\\"jobs\\\":[{\\\"conclusion\\\":\\\"success\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"test-matrix (22)\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\"},{\\\"conclusion\\\":\\\"success\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"test-matrix (24)\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\"},{\\\"conclusion\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"linux-x86_64\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"in_progress\\\"}],\\\"status\\\":\\\"in_progress\\\"}\\n\",\"ci\":\".git\\n/home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/PLAN-10_HOST_PREFLIGHT_CURRENT_SOURCE/owner.json\\n/home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/PR200_GIT_EXCLUDE_FAIL_CLOSED/owner.json\\n/home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/SEC_DEMO_GIT_CLEANUP_RACE/owner.json\\n/home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/DEFECT_GIT_EXCLUDE_FAIL_CLOSED_20261024/owner.json\\n/home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-