{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T06:49:15.489Z","ordinal":327780,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a171c1-0652-7382-b539-55af51f4c56c","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-2459f17f-8a73-40c6-ac69-4ad2b5596ce6","server":"mcp-search","tool":"work_state_read","arguments":{"list":"nexus-v1-release","includeClosed":false},"pluginId":"claude-mem@claude-mem-local","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"- nexus-v1-release: pr133_ci=Node20/22/24 and CodeQL passed exact head; Linux packaging run 39665020828 active, pr133_head=6f522952bb50d956f259068b0a34151f614c956a, next=Monitor exact PR207 and PR212 checks plus live Kimi suite; run no local tests until safe SUITE release. Merge only when exact requirements, independent review, source CI and protected checks pass. Then rebuild/reconcile RC5 candidate and resume exact artifact/install qualification; external Issue1 custody remains blocker., current_main=016bbc332d694b32072f6346e7f3127fb98b691f, sbom=PR134 merged as 049880f; exact PR CI39679493728 all4 SUCCESS, CodeQL39679493753 SUCCESS, focused SBOM closure tests 10/10 PASS, independent ACCEPT; post-merge main gates pass, active_claims=Release publisher remains active; SUITE now released after exact main CI and CodeQL terminal success; no other local test started, blocking_decision=RC2 Node floor: awaiting user's choice between DEC-12 >=20 with EOL disclosure and newer reported no-EOL mandate >=22, pr126_status=Merged 2026-10-21T23:16:39Z as f8ba4c1248d400ac321aec1d08b74437a1c8d70b after exact-head CI run39688533586 all four success and CodeQL39688533646 success. Postmerge main CI39692357597 and CodeQL39692357575 in progress. PR127/128 old checks are stale because base ffad03f; must refresh/requalify serially. PR135 CI active on previous main 049880f; refresh after terminal., pr135_status=Exact head 771849b64cccb41ed4d9fb2c6e91458c36d3e34b CI39689926298