:\"2026-10-25T06:30:37Z\"}\n{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Release convergence update (public metadata only): post-merge CI and CodeQL now pass on current main `4e7297f545538e6422ca3890334a7036f58287ca` (CI run `40156576300`, CodeQL run `40156576296`). RC4 remains the newest prerelease; no stable release or final-candidate qualification has been established. The terminal matrix remains 0/15, T4 has not run, and the reproducibility workflow has not run on an RC. The metadata-only custody request from 2026-10-24 02:16 UTC remains unanswered.\\n\\nPlease reply to that request with the current custodian/owner, status and expected timing for independent custody acceptance, and whether a lossless compatibility path or replacement corpus is planned for the current evaluator contract. Please keep the reply to public metadata; do not post prompts, answers, validators, or protected task content. No held-out payload has been accessed by this implementation lane.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-25T03:55:09Z\"}\n{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"T4 denominator reconciliation (2026-10-22, source check at `main@a4a7edd9a17a0015abdf8135ecf3c1caac05560c`): the inconsistency described in the October 18 note is no longer present in current main. `ACCEPTANCE.md` §6.2 specifies nine fault classes × five runs, including SIGTERM/resume, and PLAN-10 task 11 now says `T4 (9×5)`. The separate run-wall-time table still contains the old `8×5` estimate, but explicitly labels it historical and says it predates the nine-class correction; it is not an execution denominator.\\n\\nThis resolves the planning-text discrepancy only. T4 qualification has not run and remains gated on an accepted installed RC, frozen workload, provider/standalone prerequisites, and the other stated qualification dependencies. No threshold or denominator was changed.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-22T22:47:41Z\"}\n{\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"PLAN-10 task 12: complete the real-terminal acceptance matrix\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-25T05:02:41Z\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/3\"}\n{\"assets\":[\"compatibility.json\",\"install.sh\",\"nexus-linux-x86_64-v1.0.0-rc.4.tar.gz\",\"sbom.cdx.json\",\"sbom.cdx.json.sha256\",\"sbom.json\",\"sbom.json.sha256\",\"SHA256SUMS\",\"THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt\"],\"isPrerelease\":true,\"publishedAt\":\"2026-10-24T11:54:37Z\",\"tagName\":\"v1.0.0-rc.4\"}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":2,"nanos":746620944}},"started_at_ms":1792911051165,"completed_at_ms":1792911053913}}
