{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T06:52:01.359Z","ordinal":327924,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a171d4-9bcf-71c1-8ddc-22770248c7e3","call_id":"call_6d2879695bf741a397d4edf951d20847","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__archive_project\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nSoft-delete a project: mark it as archived so it is hidden from active project lists. All messages are preserved and the project can be restored with unarchive_project.\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__archive_project(args: { project_key: string; registration_token?: string | null; }):\n\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__ensure_project\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nIdempotently create or ensure a project exists for the given human key.\n\nWhen to use\n-----------\n- First call in a workflow targeting a new repo/path identifier.\n- As a guard before registering agents or sending messages.\n\nHow it works\n------------\n- Validates that `human_key` is an absolute directory path (the agent's workin\n\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_inbox\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nRetrieve recent messages for an agent without mutating read/ack state.\n\nFilters\n-------\n- `urgent_only`: only messages with importance in {high, urgent}\n- `since_ts`: ISO-8601 timestamp string; messages strictly newer than this are returned\n- `limit`: max number of messages (default 20)\n- `include_bodies`: include full Markdo\n\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__hard_delete_project\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nIRREVERSIBLY delete a project and ALL associated data: every agent, message, message recipient, file reservation, agent link, window identity, message summary, sibling suggestion, product link, and the entire on-disk project archive directory. This is NOT soft-delete — data is permanently destroyed and cannot be recovered. Re\n\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_contacts\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nList contact links for an agent in a project.\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_contacts(args: { agent_name: string; format?: string | null; project_key: string; registration_token?: string | null; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ result: Array<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>; }>>; };\n```\n\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_contact_handshake\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nRequest contact permissions and optionally auto-approve plus send a welcome message.\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__macro_contact_handshake(args: { agent_name?: string | null; auto_accept?: boolean; format?: string | null; model?: string | null; program?: string | null; project_key: \n\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__request_contact\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nRequest contact approval to message another agent.\n\nCreates (or refreshes) a pending AgentLink and sends a small ack_required intro message.\n\nDiscovery\n---------\nTo discover available agent names, use: resource://agents/{project_key}\nAgent names are NOT the same as program names or user names.\n\nParameters\n----------\nproject_k\n\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__respond_contact\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nApprove or deny a contact request.\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__respond_contact(args: { accept: boolean; format?: string | null; from_agent: string; from_project?: string | null; project_key: string; registration_token?: string | null; to_agent: string; ttl_seconds?: number; }): Pr\n\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__set_contact_policy\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nSet contact policy for an agent: open | auto | contacts_only | block_all.\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__set_contact_policy(args: { agent_name: string; format?: string | null; policy: string; project_key: string; registration_token?: string | null; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: \n\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__unarchive_project\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nRestore an archived project back to active status.\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__unarchive_project(args: { project_key: string; registration_token?: string | null; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]: unknown; }>>; };\n```"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a171d2-d7fe-7473-a950-3592dcbf3eab","create_time":1792911121.3590991}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
