{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T06:54:13.540Z","ordinal":327980,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a171d2-d7fe-7473-a950-3592dcbf3eab","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-a3421661-beb9-4d0b-9684-26052c8e066c","process_id":"56742","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","git -C /home/mike/nexus-code cat-file -e 016bbc332d694b32072f6346e7f3127fb98b691f:cli/src/config.ts && git -C /home/mike/nexus-code show 016bbc332d694b32072f6346e7f3127fb98b691f:cli/src/config.ts | sed -n '232,258p'; git -C /home/mike/nexus-code show 016bbc332d694b32072f6346e7f3127fb98b691f:docs/v1.0.0/DECISIONS.md | sed -n '35,44p'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"git -C /home/mike/nexus-code cat-file -e 016bbc332d694b32072f6346e7f3127fb98b691f:cli/src/config.ts && git -C /home/mike/nexus-code show 016bbc332d694b32072f6346e7f3127fb98b691f:cli/src/config.ts | sed -n '232,258p'; git -C /home/mike/nexus-code show 016bbc332d694b32072f6346e7f3127fb98b691f:docs/v1.0.0/DECISIONS.md | sed -n '35,44p'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"  const approve = Boolean(options.approve);\n  const modeOption = options.mode ? String(options.mode).toLowerCase() : undefined;\n  const envMode = (operatorSetting(\"NEXUS_APPROVAL_MODE\") || process.env.NEXUS_APPROVAL_MODE)?.trim().toLowerCase();\n\n  let approvalMode: ApprovalMode;\n  let fullAccess = Boolean(options.fullAccess);\n\n  if (readOnly) {\n    approvalMode = \"read-only\";\n  } else if (yes) {\n    approvalMode = \"auto\";\n    fullAccess = true;\n  } else if (approve) {\n    approvalMode = \"review\";\n  } else if (modeOption === \"auto\" || modeOption === \"review\" || modeOption === \"read-only\") {\n    approvalMode = modeOption as ApprovalMode;\n    if (approvalMode === \"auto\" && options.yes) fullAccess = true;\n  } else if (envMode === \"auto\" || envMode === \"review\" || envMode === \"read-only\") {\n    approvalMode = envMode as ApprovalMode;\n    if (approvalMode === \"auto\") fullAccess = true;\n  } else {\n    // Folder trust controls project instructions and integrations, not tool authority.\n    // Use an explicit full-access setting when present; otherwise default to review.\n    approvalMode = fullAccess ? \"auto\" : \"review\";\n  }\n\n  const sandbox = options.sandbox ? (typeof options.sandbox === \"string\" ? options.sandbox : true) : undefined;\n| A | Review by default: write, exec and egress ask | Safest. More prompts. Changes existing users' habits. |\n| B | Auto with an enforced sandbox by default | Few prompts. bwrap is unavailable on some hosts (WSL, rootless containers), and the Docker fallback is unpinned and networked. Egress is unsolved. |\n| **C (original choice; amended 2026-10-24)** | Permission mode controls approvals independently of workspace trust. The default is `review`. `--mode auto` permits writes and commands regardless of folder trust and keeps first-use egress approval per origin. `--yes` and `NEXUS_APPROVAL_MODE=auto` select full access and bypass confirmation prompts, including egress. | Folder trust is a separate choice for loading project instructions and workspace integrations. |\n| D | Keep auto | Contradicts REQ-SEC-101; rejected. |\n\n**Rationale.** Folder trust protects project instructions and workspace integrations from being loaded before the operator approves those sources. Tool authority is governed by the operator's permission settings and must not change when a folder is trusted. A configured `auto` mode remains the operator's choice; when no permission mode is configured, Nexus defaults to `review`.\n\n**Amendment (2026-10-24, operator direction).** This supersedes the original trust-derived mode and approval behavior. Trust affects project instruction and integration loading only; it does not select or change tool approval mode. Approval behavior follows the configured permission mode, with `review` as the unconfigured default.\n\n**Further rules:**\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":27084}},"started_at_ms":1792911253539,"completed_at_ms":1792911253539}}
