{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T06:56:43.823Z","ordinal":328092,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"task_complete","root_turn_id":"01a171d8-1e77-7a20-9e70-79f4d4f5be68","turn_id":"01a171d8-1e77-7a20-9e70-79f4d4f5be68","last_agent_message":"The suite is advancing: the live `READONLY_ADMISSION` run moved from its PTY test to its TUI surface test. I confirmed the process chain is still active and left it running.\n\nPR #207’s Node 22/24 checks and PR #212’s Linux packaging check are still running; no custodian reply has arrived. I recorded these updates in the existing claims log and release workstate. No tests were started concurrently, and the release remains unaccepted.","started_at":1792911351,"completed_at":1792911403,"duration_ms":52397,"time_to_first_token_ms":1469}}
