on, under the heading `Needs from other slices`. Mirrored as one line in the claim log. | So the owning slice's agent can pick it up. Never fixed silently out of scope. |\n98-| Slice evidence | `docs/reviews/evidence/v1/<plan>-<slice>/` (new directory per slice) | No shared evidence files, so agents cannot overwrite each other's evidence |\n99-\n100-## 7. Safe parallel lanes\n101-\n102-The following groupings can run at the same time with no hot-file contention beyond §4 claims. They are listed by milestone.\n103-\n104-| Phase | Parallel lanes |\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a171db-7c71-7fa1-9ddc-01235606cfa9","create_time":1792911699.858671}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
