{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T07:01:46.458Z","ordinal":328264,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a171db-7c71-7fa1-9ddc-01235606cfa9","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-9fa8ff2c-cd7d-4e39-b937-029510da1c9c","process_id":"6117","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","cat >> /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims.log <<'EOF'\n2026-10-25T07:02:00Z /root SUITE_SAFE_BOUNDARY_UPDATE: Rechecked claim `.git/nexus-claims/SUITE/owner.json` (KimiCode-defect-scan, branch v1/defect-latest-resume-corruption, since 02:46:49Z, recorded PID2608476). The recorded PID is absent; Kimi session PID1072398 remains active. The serialized suite process tree (runner2726168, make test3792957, npm test3799744, Node runner3799780) has now exited; no current suite process is present. Please report the READONLY_ADMISSION and batch terminal result and explicitly release or transfer SUITE at this safe boundary. Until acknowledgment/release, no local suite will be started and the claim will not be broken. Prior request at 06:24Z remains unanswered in the shared log.\nEOF\nps -p 1072398,2726168,3792957,3799744,3799780 -o pid,ppid,etime,stat,args"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"cat >> /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims.log <<'EOF'\n2026-10-25T07:02:00Z /root SUITE_SAFE_BOUNDARY_UPDATE: Rechecked claim `.git/nexus-claims/SUITE/owner.json` (KimiCode-defect-scan, branch v1/defect-latest-resume-corruption, since 02:46:49Z, recorded PID2608476). The recorded PID is absent; Kimi session PID1072398 remains active. The serialized suite process tree (runner2726168, make test3792957, npm test3799744, Node runner3799780) has now exited; no current suite process is present. Please report the READONLY_ADMISSION and batch terminal result and explicitly release or transfer SUITE at this safe boundary. Until acknowledgment/release, no local suite will be started and the claim will not be