{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T07:05:55.557Z","ordinal":328374,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a171e0-e13c-74a2-bb32-6d6dfeb41b0f","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-934abb20-8b0f-45bd-873e-b3f7d648d704","process_id":"2497","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh pr view 213 --json title,body,author,headRefOid,baseRefOid --jq '{title,body,author:.author.login,head:.headRefOid,base:.baseRefOid}'; gh pr view 212 --json title,body,headRefOid,baseRefOid --jq '{title,body,head:.headRefOid,base:.baseRefOid}'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh pr view 213 --json title,body,author,headRefOid,baseRefOid --jq '{title,body,author:.author.login,head:.headRefOid,base:.baseRefOid}'; gh pr view 212 --json title,body,headRefOid,baseRefOid --jq '{title,body,head:.headRefOid,base:.baseRefOid}'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"base\":\"016bbc332d694b32072f6346e7f3127fb98b691f\",\"body\":\"## Summary\\n\\nCurrent-main PR for the fail-closed Nexus state exclusion and verified filesystem cleanup fix. This supersedes PR #207’s GitHub comparison, which remained pinned to historical base `19b30a4` and displayed unrelated merged files after its branch update. The existing PR history and comments are preserved separately.\\n\\n- Base: current `main` at `016bbc332d694b32072f6346e7f3127fb98b691f`.\\n- Head: `7a5d4dcc3d35c68caf8a93a3bdeb2d7141101153`.\\n- Exact six-file source diff SHA-256: `55b0230bcdb125cecc263c83afbb83dc9bc54cab24ca557209a92f57d503de7a`.\\n- Independent exact-head review: ACCEPT; same six-file diff hash.\\n- Requirements gate: `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce` passed with isolated HOME/XDG (123 rows; 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 exact-RC deferrals).\\n- `git diff --check`: passed.\\n\\nExact-head CI and CodeQL will run on this PR. The local five-snapshot suite owned by another agent ended without a captured result; it remains classified incomplete/unreconciled, and the SUITE claim has not been released. No local test result is claimed.\\n\\nNo installed-RC qualification or release acceptance is claimed here.\\n\",\"head\":\"7a5d4dcc3d35c68caf8a93a3bdeb2d7141101153\",\"title\":\"fix(git): safely exclude Nexus workspace state\"}\n{\"base\":\"016bbc332d694b32072f6346e7f3127fb98b691f\",\"body\":\"## Summary\\n\\nReconcile the RC5 candidate release notes with current `main` at `016bbc332d694b32072f6346e7f3127fb98b691f`. The notes cover changes from merged PRs #203–206 and #208–211; open PR #207 is excluded.\\n\\nThe exact notes diff SHA-256 is `d737494a1d518a5108c307171fc3caf38ef82e5c836727fc7156a4f822264086`. Independent read-only review ACCEPTed this exact head and diff hash. The changes are documentation-only; `git diff --check` passes.\\n\\n## Release status\\n\\nThis PR does not create or publish an RC, select an accepted candidate, or claim qualification or stable-release acceptance. Installed-RC, held-out custody, terminal matrix, T4, RC reproducibility, independent product acceptance, and required human acceptance remain separate release gates.\\n\",\"head\":\"8b7c09c76bf4e1c67794bdb9941bb50a0121b81b\",\"title\":\"docs(release): reconcile v1.0.0-rc.5 release notes\"}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":912575706}},"started_at_ms":1792911954644,"completed_at_ms":1792911955557}}
