{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T07:16:41.775Z","ordinal":328672,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a171e6-e7a2-7bb2-92f7-17944d46f4b1","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-54cbc79f-7f47-493c-950f-94a6d2d42596","process_id":"78237","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh pr view 200 --json body,author,updatedAt,createdAt,comments,reviews,statusCheckRollup --jq '{author:.author.login,createdAt,updatedAt,body,reviews:[.reviews[]|{author:.author.login,state,submittedAt}],checks:[.statusCheckRollup[]|select(.name!=null)|{name,status,conclusion}]}' ; gh pr diff 200 | git patch-id --stable; git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/pr213-git-exclude diff 016bbc332d694b32072f6346e7f3127fb98b691f..HEAD | git patch-id --stable; git ls-remote origin refs/heads/v1/defect-git-exclude-fail-closed"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh pr view 200 --json body,author,updatedAt,createdAt,comments,reviews,statusCheckRollup --jq '{author:.author.login,createdAt,updatedAt,body,reviews:[.reviews[]|{author:.author.login,state,submittedAt}],checks:[.statusCheckRollup[]|select(.name!=null)|{name,status,conclusion}]}' ; gh pr diff 200 | git patch-id --stable; git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/pr213-git-exclude diff 016bbc332d694b32072f6346e7f3127fb98b691f..HEAD | git patch-id --stable; git ls-remote origin refs/heads/v1/defect-git-exclude-fail-closed"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"## Summary\\n\\n- Keep `.nexus/` exclusion fail-closed when Git still considers protected Nexus state visible.\\n- Avoid appending duplicate rules on every retry when a higher-priority repository ignore rule defeats `info/exclude`.\\n- Append a final positive rule when a later negation in `info/exclude` can be overridden.\\n- Defer exclusion-file mutation from `WorktreeManager` construction until a worktree is actually created.\\n- Apply the self-ignore at the repository root, where Nexus stores worktrees, even when the selected workspace is a subdirectory.\\n- Reject unsafe `.nexus` ignore targets and add regressions for negation, symlink/hard-link paths, unavailable Git metadata, and nested workspaces.\\n- Make `writeExclusiveVerified` and `mkdirVerified` leave raced entries untouched after failed verification, avoiding path-based cleanup that could delete a replacement. Their contents are not written before verification.\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- Focused Git exclusion tests: 11/11 passed on implementation commit `5068bcf` with isolated `HOME` and `XDG_CONFIG_HOME` (historical; predates the new race regressions).\\n- Focused flight/worktree tests: 6/6 passed on implementation commit `5068bcf` with isolated `HOME` and `XDG_CONFIG_HOME` (historical).\\n- `tsc --noEmit`: passed on commit `81928bd` with isolated `HOME` and `XDG_CONFIG_HOME`.\\n- `git diff --check`: passed on exact PR diff.\\n- Independent read-only review: ACCEPT on exact PR diff SHA-256 `3bd2245f532151c94bac0ebf71ede8706d0609598f8b94e9cdee6ed640fa42b8`.\\n- Exact-head CI run `40130531444` and CodeQL run `40130531552` are in progress. A full local suite is also active on a separate immutable snapshot; no overlapping local test has been started.\\n\\n## Base\\n\\n- `main` at `29eab4cd58051a8210b5ef66e0c9e248b2046a13`.\\n\",\"checks\":[{\"conclusion\":\"CANCELLED\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (22)\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"name\":\"javascript-typescript\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":\"CANCELLED\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (24)\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":\"SKIPPED\",\"name\":\"linux-x86_64\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"name\":\"CodeQL\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"}],\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-24T17:35:29Z\",\"reviews\":[{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T17:42:47Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:01:15Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:23:14Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:46:02Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T19:01:11Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T19:11:30Z\"}],\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-24T20:56:13Z\"}\n6b5d0cfb1bf756a24de06b553f6fafa4d82e0cae 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000\n24fc5989254b08b5cdb9b9378ba65918df4e9697 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000\n81928bd81d10ec957a3063a0e414aef981c83b20\trefs/heads/v1/defect-git-exclude-fail-closed\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":800105347}},"started_at_ms":1792912599970,"completed_at_ms":1792912601772}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T07:16:42.880Z","ordinal":328673,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a171eb-3700-7530-85ae-a7204336d59f","call_id":"call_800bd07b5fc046308722eedafac8fd90","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 4.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"## Summary\\n\\n- Keep `.nexus/` exclusion fail-closed when Git still considers protected Nexus state visible.\\n- Avoid appending duplicate rules on every retry when a higher-priority repository ignore rule defeats `info/exclude`.\\n- Append a final positive rule when a later negation in `info/exclude` can be overridden.\\n- Defer exclusion-file mutation from `WorktreeManager` construction until a worktree is actually created.\\n- Apply the self-ignore at the repository root, where Nexus stores worktrees, even when the selected workspace is a subdirectory.\\n- Reject unsafe `.nexus` ignore targets and add regressions for negation, symlink/hard-link paths, unavailable Git metadata, and nested workspaces.\\n- Make `writeExclusiveVerified` and `mkdirVerified` leave raced entries untouched after failed verification, avoiding path-based cleanup that could delete a replacement. Their contents are not written before verification.\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- Focused Git exclusion tests: 11/11 passed on implementation commit `5068bcf` with isolated `HOME` and `XDG_CONFIG_HOME` (historical; predates the new race regressions).\\n- Focused flight/worktree tests: 6/6 passed on implementation commit `5068bcf` with isolated `HOME` and `XDG_CONFIG_HOME` (historical).\\n- `tsc --noEmit`: passed on commit `81928bd` with isolated `HOME` and `XDG_CONFIG_HOME`.\\n- `git diff --check`: passed on exact PR diff.\\n- Independent read-only review: ACCEPT on exact PR diff SHA-256 `3bd2245f532151c94bac0ebf71ede8706d0609598f8b94e9cdee6ed640fa42b8`.\\n- Exact-head CI run `40130531444` and CodeQL run `40130531552` are in progress. A full local suite is also active on a separate immutable snapshot; no overlapping local test has been started.\\n\\n## Base\\n\\n- `main` at `29eab4cd58051a8210b5ef66e0c9e248b2046a13`.\\n\",\"checks\":[{\"conclusion\":\"CANCELLED\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (22)\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"name\":\"javascript-typescript\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":\"CANCELLED\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (24)\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":\"SKIPPED\",\"name\":\"linux-x86_64\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"},{\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"name\":\"CodeQL\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\"}],\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-24T17:35:29Z\",\"reviews\":[{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T17:42:47Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:01:15Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:23:14Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:46:02Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T19:01:11Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T19:11:30Z\"}],\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-24T20:56:13Z\"}\n6b5d0cfb1bf756a24de06b553f6fafa4d82e0cae 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000\n24fc5989254b08b5cdb9b9378ba65918df4e9697 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000\n81928bd81d10ec957a3063a0e414aef981c83b20\trefs/heads/v1/defect-git-exclude-fail-closed\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a171e6-e7a2-7bb2-92f7-17944d46f4b1","create_time":1792912602.8804016}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
