s classified incomplete/unreconciled, and the SUITE claim has not been released. No local test result is claimed.\\n\\nNo installed-RC qualification or release acceptance is claimed here.\\nEOF\\ngh pr edit 213 --body-file /tmp/nexus-pr213-body.md\",workdir:\"/home/mike/nexus-code\",yield_time_ms:10000,max_output_tokens:250});\ntext(r.output);","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a171e6-e7a2-7bb2-92f7-17944d46f4b1","create_time":1792912680.4472835}}}
