{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T07:22:52.623Z","ordinal":328850,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016addae4b591881a0983b538fe945f714","status":"completed","call_id":"call_90e0e68f8ba24f43bde6e900b700015a","name":"exec","input":"const r=await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"cat >> /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims.log <<'EOF'\\n2026-10-25T07:22:49Z /root LIVE_CI_RECHECK: Exact post-merge main05994a40c6e13bdaad9348fe62751220f7f53099 CI40171717813 Node24 SUCCESS; Node22 still IN_PROGRESS at npm CLI suite; CodeQL40171717805 SUCCESS. PR213 exact head7a5d4dc/base016bbc3 Node22/24 npm CLI suites IN_PROGRESS; CodeQL/JS-TS pass. No SUITE runner process; Kimi PID1072398 remains active, claim/result/release unresolved. PR213 branch refresh deferred until these live runs terminate to avoid superseding active test executions.\\nEOF\\n\",yield_time_ms:10000,max_output_tokens:100});\ntext(r.output);","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a171ef-39dd-7c10-822f-63a5ddd8b6ec","create_time":1792912971.3501291}}}
