{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T07:31:28.514Z","ordinal":329184,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a171f7-072f-7b22-b313-9d5241d78ccb","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016addb04f085081a0885f4bf71cd8b3d2","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Current authoritative main remains `05994a40c6e13bdaad9348fe62751220f7f53099`. I verified the pre-RC requirements gate passes on that exact revision, and a read-only merge preview for PR #213 is clean and preserves the RC5 notes.\n\nCI is still active: main’s Linux package job is running the CLI suite; PR #213’s Node 22/24 suites have no terminal result. Kimi’s SUITE claim remains protected. Its active test is in a different worktree/branch than the claim record, so I logged the mismatch and requested reconciliation without interrupting the run.\n\nHeld-out custody remains unresolved, no RC5 is tagged, and acceptance remains **IN_PROGRESS**. Folder trust and approval are already separate on main, with review as the default."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1792913487054,"completed_at_ms":1792913488513}}
