olation (REQ-QUAL-101/102/106)\n9013dba (v1/plan-10-pr-10c) feat(eval): T4 fault injection through the model proxy, scored per fault (REQ-QUAL-105, REQ-QUAL-110)\n74f0e3f (v1/plan-10-pr-10b, v1/candidate-10b) feat(eval): run validity checks: task schema, model fingerprint, hidden-test isolation (REQ-QUAL-101/102/106)\n3a790c5 feat(eval): symmetric infrastructure classification and scorer integrity (REQ-QUAL-106, EVL-002/003/005)\nca8d733 feat(safety): execution posture resolution, REPL/TUI/doctor posture banners, and test fixture updates (PLAN-01 PR-1b)\n750b208 docs(eval): Stage 8 T2 pilot — not qualified (2 false VERIFIED); infra reruns, merged scoring\neb114fa docs(eval): Stage 8 T2 pilot — not qualified (2 false VERIFIED); infra reruns, merged scoring\nede562e feat(eval): pilot pre-registration — six T2 tasks, peer adapters, 10-point margin\n59961bd feat(eval): pilot pre-registration — six T2 tasks, peer adapters, 10-point margin\n76f4081 feat(eval): Stage 8 harness — runner, separate scores, T1 self-test; R3 dogfood fact-check (not accepted)\nbc498ee feat(eval): Stage 8 harness — runner, separate scores, T1 self-test; R3 dogfood fact-check (not accepted)\ncf8e7ef docs(qualification): retain ambiguous timing as historical estimate\n36f011a docs(qualification): reconcile plan with nine T4 classes\n8fcaa52 docs(v1.0.0): audit, requirements, roadmap, specs, plans and acceptance package\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a171fd-3278-7ca3-ad25-d2f716cb2b15","create_time":1792913859.2187545}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
