{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T07:56:56.926Z","ordinal":330446,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1720a-a8c7-71b0-a2a7-c61907b1cef0","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-59b871cf-9305-4d15-ab96-9fbedd696478","process_id":"50781","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","common=$(git rev-parse --git-common-dir); printf '%s\\n' '2026-10-25T09:08:00Z /root T4_SCORER_AND_SMOKE_TESTS_PASS: The T4 scorer integrity case passed 1/1 and the two T4 smoke cases passed 2/2 on ubuntu-desktop using a snapshot of exact base 05994a4 plus only this claimed slice diff. Source test runner used a fresh isolated HOME/XDG and the exact-main CI package harness-core; no inference or held-out data. An initial attempt under /tmp was correctly refused by the harness protected-runtime-root policy and is recorded as an environment-path setup failure; relocating the disposable snapshot under /home/mike allowed the tests to run. Local Kimi SUITE remains active; no local tests were started.' >> \"$common/nexus-claims.log\"; git diff --check; node --check eval/score.mjs; git status --short --branch"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/plan10-pr10c-t4","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"common=$(git rev-parse --git-common-dir); printf '%s\\n' '2026-10-25T09:08:00Z /root T4_SCORER_AND_SMOKE_TESTS_PASS: The T4 scorer integrity case passed 1/1 and the two T4 smoke cases passed 2/2 on ubuntu-desktop using a snapshot of exact base 05994a4 plus only this claimed slice diff. Source test runner used a fresh isolated HOME/XDG and the exact-main CI package harness-core; no inference or held-out data. An initial attempt under /tmp was correctly refused by the harness protected-runtime-root policy and is recorded as an environment-path setup failure; relocating the disposable snapshot under /home/mike allowed the tests to run. Local Kimi SUITE remains active; no local tests were started.' >> \"$common/nexus-claims.log\"; git diff --check; node --check eval/score.mjs; git status --short --branch"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"## v1/plan-10-pr10c-t4-qualification...origin/main\n M cli/test/eval_harness.test.ts\n M cli/test/eval_integrity.test.ts\n M eval/score.mjs\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":6239660}},"started_at_ms":1792915015920,"completed_at_ms":1792915016926}}
