rer integrity case passed 1/1 and the two T4 smoke cases passed 2/2 on ubuntu-desktop using a snapshot of exact base 05994a4 plus only this claimed slice diff. Source test runner used a fresh isolated HOME/XDG and the exact-main CI package harness-core; no inference or held-out data. An initial attempt under /tmp was correctly refused by the harness protected-runtime-root policy and is recorded as an environment-path setup failure; relocating the disposable snapshot under /home/mike allowed the tests to run. Local Kimi SUITE remains active; no local tests were started.\n M cli/test/eval_harness.test.ts\n M cli/test/eval_integrity.test.ts\n M eval/score.mjs\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1720a-a8c7-71b0-a2a7-c61907b1cef0","create_time":1792915055.145684}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
