{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T07:58:15.427Z","ordinal":330513,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1720a-a8c7-71b0-a2a7-c61907b1cef0","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016addb6963a6481a0ad88a9542e60c3c9","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Understood: the default approval mode is **Review**. Folder trust stays separate from tool approvals.\n\nThat behavior is already present on `origin/main` at `05994a4`: the CLI defaults to Review, and the startup trust screen says trust does not change approvals. The source and PTY tests are in [startup_trust.ts](/home/mike/nexus-wt/plan10-pr10c-t4/cli/src/startup_trust.ts) and [startup_trust_prompt.test.ts](/home/mike/nexus-wt/plan10-pr10c-t4/cli/test/startup_trust_prompt.test.ts). I made no changes. The shared suite claim is active, so I did not run tests; if your installed `nexus` still behaves differently, it may be using an older build."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1792915094257,"completed_at_ms":1792915095427}}
