{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T07:58:30.604Z","ordinal":330517,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"task_complete","root_turn_id":"01a1720a-a8c7-71b0-a2a7-c61907b1cef0","turn_id":"01a1720a-a8c7-71b0-a2a7-c61907b1cef0","last_agent_message":"Understood: the default approval mode is **Review**. Folder trust stays separate from tool approvals.\n\nThat behavior is already present on `origin/main` at `05994a4`: the CLI defaults to Review, and the startup trust screen says trust does not change approvals. The source and PTY tests are in [startup_trust.ts](/home/mike/nexus-wt/plan10-pr10c-t4/cli/src/startup_trust.ts) and [startup_trust_prompt.test.ts](/home/mike/nexus-wt/plan10-pr10c-t4/cli/test/startup_trust_prompt.test.ts). I made no changes. The shared suite claim is active, so I did not run tests; if your installed `nexus` still behaves differently, it may be using an older build.","started_at":1792914663,"completed_at":1792915110,"duration_ms":446971,"time_to_first_token_ms":1224}}
