{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T08:16:26.956Z","ordinal":331476,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17211-7ad4-71c1-9c02-690a797dca89","item":{"type":"McpToolCall","id":"exec-8f86f689-c77e-4285-bc2f-05df545ff2a3","server":"mcp-search","tool":"work_state_read","arguments":{"list":"nexus-v1-release","includeClosed":true},"pluginId":"claude-mem@claude-mem-local","readOnlyHint":true,"status":"completed","result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"- nexus-v1-release: pr133_ci=Node20/22/24 and CodeQL passed exact head; Linux packaging run 39665020828 active, pr133_head=6f522952bb50d956f259068b0a34151f614c956a, next=Monitor exact PR213 CI/CodeQL and SUITE ownership. Once safe, run targeted candidate/git-exclude tests and full suites on immutable snapshot under isolated HOME, then request fresh independent acceptance on exact diff. Integrate only after required gates. Refresh RC5 release notes and review after merge; release remains blocked on Issue #1 custody, installed-RC qualification, human acceptance, and stable publication., current_main=05994a40c6e13bdaad9348fe62751220f7f53099, sbom=PR134 merged as 049880f; exact PR CI39679493728 all4 SUCCESS, CodeQL39679493753 SUCCESS, focused SBOM closure tests 10/10 PASS, independent ACCEPT; post-merge main gates pass, active_claims=Release publisher remains active; SUITE now released after exact main CI and CodeQL terminal success; no other local test started, blocking_decision=RC2 Node floor: awaiting user's choice between DEC-12 >=20 with EOL disclosure and newer reported no-EOL mandate >=22, pr126_status=Merged 2026-10-21T23:16:39Z as f8ba4c1248d400ac321aec1d08b74437a1c8d70b after exact-head CI run39688533586 all four success and CodeQL39688533646 success. Postmerge main CI39692357597 and CodeQL39692357575 in progress. PR127/128 old checks are stale because base ffad03f; must refresh/requalify serially. PR135 CI active on previous main 049880f; refresh