rn COMPLETED; runner records these observations rather than unconditional resumed=true. Supervisor defers cgroup cleanup/escalation until SIGTERM grace elapses even when main child exits, allowing descendants to flush. Added regressions for missing resume evidence/inactive signal and descendant flush. On ubuntu-desktop isolated snapshot with fresh HOME/XDG: T4 scorer+supervisor focused patterns 2/2 PASS; T4 smoke patterns 2/2 PASS; diff-check PASS. No inference, held-out task, or full suite. Independent read-only re-review requested; no commit/PR until disposition.\nEOF\n tail -n 2 \"$common/nexus-claims.log\""}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"2026-10-25T08:11:59Z codex-root PLAN-10_PR-10c progress: added cgroup-supervisor FD control channel for graceful SIGTERM delivery to every payload pid with bounded forced cleanup; added host fixture proving handler writes its state marker before supervisor cleanup; run-agent signals only after first model response and restarts Nexus with --resume; scorer rejects runner-fault labels lacking runner evidence; task validation accepts sigterm_resume only on T4; corrected memory enforcement fixture to allocate tmpfs-backed pages (instead of output-limited tail). Separate ubuntu-desktop targeted checks: T4 scoring + task validation + graceful signal 3/3 PASS; T4 proxy smoke 2/2 PASS. Broader resource-contract check confirmed memory OOM and process-count enforcement, then failed at workspace-storage assertion because this host uses shared /dev/shm rather than required dedicated size-capped tmpfs; recorded as environment prerequisite, not pass. No held-out tasks/inference. Exact source base 05994a40c6e13bdaad9348fe62751220f7f53099; independent review pending.\n2026-10-25T09:12:00Z /root PLAN-10_PR-10c_FOLLOWUP_FIXES: Addressed independent T4 review findings in claimed worktree /home/mike/nexus-wt/plan10-pr10c-t4, branch v1/plan-10-pr10c-t4-qualification, exact base 05994a40c6e13bdaad9348fe6275