ized next slice, but the branch/scope mismatch is not yet recorded in owner.json or the log. Do not interrupt active tests; at the next safe boundary, please reconcile the active suite scope/branch and report the exact result, then release or transfer if complete. No other suite started by /root.\n2026-10-25T07:35:00Z /root CLAIM PLAN-10_PR-10c: Claimed PLAN-10 PR-10c and hot files eval/run.mjs, eval/score.mjs, eval/validate.mjs, cli/test/eval_integrity.test.ts, eval/README.md at exact origin/main 05994a40c6e13bdaad9348fe62751220f7f53099. Scope is T4 coverage gap: currently only six model-proxy faults are represented/scored; implement bounded synthetic fixture and runner handling for the hanging-command, full-disk, and SIGTERM-resume classes, plus per-class scoring/evidence. No held-out task access, no live inference, no threshold changes. Worktree /home/mike/nexus-wt/plan10-pr10c-t4 on v1/plan-10-pr10c-t4-qualification. SUITE remains owned by Kimi; no tests until explicit release.\n2026-10-25T08:15:00Z /root SUITE_SAFE_BOUNDARY_REQUEST: KimiCode-defect-scan now holds SUITE for branch v1/defect-objective-continuation-timeout since 08:08Z (short local-mock reproduction, no live inference). The prior suite process tree is absent; the new task is reported as a local mock. Please report the exact command/revision and result, and explicitly release SUITE or state the remaining serial validation window. No suite or targeted test will overlap this protected claim.\n2026-10-25T08:25:00Z /root T4_SCORER_SOURCE_PROGRESS: On v1/plan-10-pr10c-t4-qualification@05994a40, scorer now emits all nine required rows, validates proxy-vs-task/runner event provenance, excludes non-T4 records from qualification counts, and requires 5 truthful T4 runs per class. Synthetic regression cases added; node --check eval/score.mjs and git diff --check pass. No behavioral tests run: SUITE remains Kimi-owned for short local mock, and the 08:15 safe-boundary update is unanswered. Actual fixture/runner