ented,7 open; 12 exact-RC deferrals). Exact CI40174568856 and CodeQL40174568839 queued. Older 8230 CI cancelled after fixture-only follow-up; older 7a5 and 5b CI cancelled on infinite-loop review finding. SUITE claim remains held by Kimi; no local test.\n2026-10-25T09:02:00Z /root T4_TARGETED_TESTS_REMOTE: Separate host ubuntu-desktop, Node22.22.1. Snapshot source base 05994a40c6e13bdaad9348fe62751220f7f53099 plus exact 3-file working diff. T4 scoring test `test/eval_integrity.test.ts` pattern `T4 scoring requires all nine classes and five injected runs per class`: 1/1 PASS. `test/eval_harness.test.ts` pattern `T4 smoke:`: 2/2 PASS. Fresh HOME/XDG used and removed. Harness core sourced from successful exact-main CI40171717813 package artifact 12591611369; tarball SHA256 d1b201295de970e88283e297cbef93c486e13c230e3e5a5befe5a0dc46922527, harness-core SHA256 1f42db93163d50daf2cd2816db9c0e9adb674a4733c93def40d0ce57f4d8e320 verified identical after transfer. Host test workspace remains isolated under /home/mike/nexus-t4-validation-work/snapshot; no shared checkout changes, held-out data, or inference. These are targeted source tests only, not T4 qualification.\n2026-10-25T09:08:00Z /root T4_SCORER_AND_SMOKE_TESTS_PASS: The T4 scorer integrity case passed 1/1 and the two T4 smoke cases passed 2/2 on ubuntu-desktop using a snapshot of exact base 05994a4 plus only this claimed slice diff. Source test runner used a fresh isolated HOME/XDG and the exact-main CI package harness-core; no inference or held-out data. An initial attempt under /tmp was correctly refused by the harness protected-runtime-root policy and is recorded as an environment-path setup failure; relocating the disposable snapshot under /home/mike allowed the tests to run. Local Kimi SUITE remains active; no local tests were started.\n2026-10-25T08:02:01Z codex-root CLAIM FILE_eval_resources.mjs FILE_eval_cgroup_supervisor.mjs for PLAN-10 T4 SIGTERM/resume orchestration\n2026-10-25T08:11:59Z codex-root PLAN-10_P