{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T08:18:42.958Z","ordinal":331628,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_01a17223-fa8e-7103-8a81-c39ba824ebf0","call_id":"call_5047f0fccf09461fb69fd17df08eead3","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/current_main_rc_path_audit\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"**ACCEPT.** The notes match the merged PRs. PR #207 remains open, and no unmerged #207 change is claimed; the `.nexus/` commit-exclusion behavior is already present on the base through merged PR #198. The notes describe RC5 artifacts as expected workflow outputs and do not claim that RC5 is tagged, published, or accepted.\\n\\nRead-only review; no tests were run.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/pr207_independent_review\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"**ACCEPT** — candidate `fb36b03c2ad9a22f4e94139accccee1d2f137ae3` versus current `main` at `016bbc332d694b32072f6346e7f3127fb98b691f`.\\n\\nThe six-file security patch is unchanged. Its diff SHA-256 is `55b0230bcdb125cecc263c83afbb83dc9bc54cab24ca557209a92f57d503de7a`.\\n\\nThe reported 18-file diff against stale base `19b30a4` includes 12 files changed on current `main` since that base; they add no candidate-only changes versus current `main`. Refreshing the PR base to `016bbc3` will make its displayed scope clear. `git diff --check` is clean. I did not run tests.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/t4_runner_independent_review\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"**ACCEPT** for the requested follow-up scope. The runner now records the payload signal from the supervisor report separately from the `systemd-run` wrapper’s exit signal, and the scorer requires `payloadExitSignal === \\\"SIGTERM\\\"` plus successful resume and active-turn evidence. The tests include a wrapper-only signal rejection case. The supervisor defers cleanup until the grace period expires when the main process exits before descendants.\\n\\n`git diff --check` passes. I did not run tests; the reported Ubuntu 2/2 result is external to this review.\"}}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17211-7ad4-71c1-9c02-690a797dca89","create_time":1792916322.9585578}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
