{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T08:19:33.745Z","ordinal":331663,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"task_complete","root_turn_id":"01a17211-7ad4-71c1-9c02-690a797dca89","turn_id":"01a17211-7ad4-71c1-9c02-690a797dca89","last_agent_message":"Understood: **default to review**. Folder trust stays separate from tool approvals; the current main already uses review as the default, so no source change was needed for that preference.\n\nI also completed the T4 SIGTERM/resume fixes in commit `982de35a1f08287b877a34c19061d11e60301398` on the isolated qualification branch. Independent review accepted the changes. Focused evaluator checks passed 2/2, and T4 smoke checks passed 2/2 on the Ubuntu validation host with an isolated HOME. No provider inference or held-out tasks were used.\n\nThe exact main revision `05994a40c6e13bdaad9348fe62751220f7f53099` has successful CI run `40171717813` and CodeQL run `40171717805`. Those results do not qualify this new commit. I did not run a full suite because the shared SUITE claim is protected.\n\nThe branch is committed locally but not pushed: the repository’s `AGENTS.md` reserves pushes and GitHub changes for the owner. Acceptance remains **IN_PROGRESS**; the T4 hanging-command and full-disk classes, held-out custody acceptance, and exact-RC qualification remain outstanding. RC4 is still the latest published prerelease; v1.0.0 has not been accepted or released.","started_at":1792915110,"completed_at":1792916373,"duration_ms":1263123,"time_to_first_token_ms":3232}}
