{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T08:20:37.832Z","ordinal":331716,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17224-c0fe-79f1-a031-0db884e4ebbb","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-fdfadf5c-586a-48dc-ad64-ba3dc8f021fb","process_id":"11055","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","sed -n '45,80p' docs/v1.0.0/specs/SPEC-10-v1-qualification-and-evaluation.md; rg -n 'RESOURCE|T4_FAULT|full_disk|hanging_test' eval/validate.mjs eval/score.mjs cli/test/eval_integrity.test.ts eval/run.mjs"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/plan10-pr10c-t4","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"read","cmd":"sed -n '45,80p' docs/v1.0.0/specs/SPEC-10-v1-qualification-and-evaluation.md","name":"SPEC-10-v1-qualification-and-evaluation.md","path":"docs/v1.0.0/specs/SPEC-10-v1-qualification-and-evaluation.md"},{"type":"search","cmd":"rg -n 'RESOURCE|T4_FAULT|full_disk|hanging_test' eval/validate.mjs eval/score.mjs cli/test/eval_integrity.test.ts eval/run.mjs","query":"RESOURCE|T4_FAULT|full_disk|hanging_test","path":"validate.mjs"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"   - The pilot tasks and the routing engx tasks are the *development* set only.\n2. **REQ-QUAL-102. Matched conditions.** Each run records:\n   - a clean RC commit;\n   - a model fingerprint: weights sha256, server kind and build, and sampling (temperature 0, or a fixed seed where supported);\n   - identical step and minute budgets;\n   - an allow-listed environment;\n   - serial execution, or recorded queueing.\n\n   A run with any field missing is invalid.\n3. **REQ-QUAL-103. Repetitions and peers.** At least 5 runs per (task, config). Matched peers are Goose and OpenCode on the same model (DEC-05).\n4. **REQ-QUAL-104. Metrics, reported separately.**\n   - hidden-test correctness;\n   - completion claimed;\n   - **false VERIFIED** (hard gate = 0);\n   - regressions (repo suite, plus a pre/post diff of previously passing tests);\n   - crash rate and timeout rate;\n   - bounded-failure truthfulness;\n   - operator interventions (= 0 in `run` mode);\n   - tokens and wall time per correct task.\n5. **REQ-QUAL-105. T4 fault injection.** 9 fault classes × 5 runs (DEC-05 amendment, 2026-10-17: the union of the distinct scenarios below):\n   1. gateway refuses connections mid-turn;\n   2. 5xx/overloaded;\n   3. stream cut mid-tool-call;\n   4. output-limit truncation;\n   5. hanging test command;\n   6. workspace disk full;\n   7. context overflow at 32k;\n   8. malformed tool-call JSON;\n   9. SIGTERM mid-turn, then resume.\n\n   Gate (proposal): 100% truthful outcome, 0 false VERIFIED, 0 hangs beyond budget + 5 minutes.\n6. **REQ-QUAL-106. Scoring integrity.**\n   - Infrastructure reruns are symmetric and evidence-based: the endpoint was unreachable before the first model call.\n   - Contaminated runs are excluded from pooled rates.\n   - Hidden tests are not readable by the agent uid.\n   - The scorer logs every replacement.\ncli/test/eval_integrity.test.ts:234:  const kinds = [\"refuse\", \"overloaded\", \"stream_cut\", \"truncate\", \"hanging_test_command\", \"full_disk\", \"context_overflow\", \"malformed_tool_json\", \"sigterm_resume\"];\ncli/test/eval_integrity.test.ts:236:    const runnerClass = [\"hanging_test_command\", \"full_disk\", \"sigterm_resume\"].includes(kind);\ncli/test/eval_integrity.test.ts:239:      : kind === \"hanging_test_command\"\ncli/test/eval_integrity.test.ts:241:        : kind === \"full_disk\"\ncli/test/eval_integrity.test.ts:254:      model: [\"hanging_test_command\", \"full_disk\", \"sigterm_resume\"].includes(kind) ? { faultsInjected: [] } : { faultsInjected: [event] },\ncli/test/eval_integrity.test.ts:255:      t4FaultsInjected: [\"hanging_test_command\", \"full_disk\", \"sigterm_resume\"].includes(kind) ? [event] : [],\ncli/test/eval_integrity.test.ts:367:  assert.match(validateTask({ ...good, tier: \"T4\", t4RunnerFault: \"full_disk\" }, dir).join(), /supported only as sigterm_resume on a T4 task/);\neval/score.mjs:8:const T4_FAULT_CLASSES = [\neval/score.mjs:13:  \"hanging_test_command\",\neval/score.mjs:14:  \"full_disk\",\neval/score.mjs:21:const T4_RUNNER_CLASSES = new Set([\"hanging_test_command\", \"full_disk\", \"sigterm_resume\"]);\neval/score.mjs:148:  if (event.kind === \"hanging_test_command\") return evidence.observedHung === true && evidence.timedOut === true && evidence.containmentCleaned === true;\neval/score.mjs:149:  if (event.kind === \"full_disk\") return evidence.writeFailedWithEnospc === true && Number.isSafeInteger(evidence.storageLimitBytes) && evidence.storageLimitBytes > 0;\neval/score.mjs:156:const faultRows = T4_FAULT_CLASSES.map((kind) => {\neval/score.mjs:176:  requiredClasses: T4_FAULT_CLASSES.length,\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":808126687}},"started_at_ms":1792916437023,"completed_at_ms":1792916437831}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T08:20:38.985Z","ordinal":331717,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a17225-bfc8-7682-897c-702da0a1628e","call_id":"call_3e008f0e541c43f68e34d88cebbd3cd4","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 3.2 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"   - The pilot tasks and the routing engx tasks are the *development* set only.\n2. **REQ-QUAL-102. Matched conditions.** Each run records:\n   - a clean RC commit;\n   - a model fingerprint: weights sha256, server kind and build, and sampling (temperature 0, or a fixed seed where supported);\n   - identical step and minute budgets;\n   - an allow-listed environment;\n   - serial execution, or recorded queueing.\n\n   A run with any field missing is invalid.\n3. **REQ-QUAL-103. Repetitions and peers.** At least 5 runs per (task, config). Matched peers are Goose and OpenCode on the same model (DEC-05).\n4. **REQ-QUAL-104. Metrics, reported separately.**\n   - hidden-test correctness;\n   - completion claimed;\n   - **false VERIFIED** (hard gate = 0);\n   - regressions (repo suite, plus a pre/post diff of previously passing tests);\n   - crash rate and timeout rate;\n   - bounded-failure truthfulness;\n   - operator interventions (= 0 in `run` mode);\n   - tokens and wall time per correct task.\n5. **REQ-QUAL-105. T4 fault injection.** 9 fault classes × 5 runs (DEC-05 amendment, 2026-10-17: the union of the distinct scenarios below):\n   1. gateway refuses connections mid-turn;\n   2. 5xx/overloaded;\n   3. stream cut mid-tool-call;\n   4. output-limit truncation;\n   5. hanging test command;\n   6. workspace disk full;\n   7. context overflow at 32k;\n   8. malformed tool-call JSON;\n   9. SIGTERM mid-turn, then resume.\n\n   Gate (proposal): 100% truthful outcome, 0 false VERIFIED, 0 hangs beyond budget + 5 minutes.\n6. **REQ-QUAL-106. Scoring integrity.**\n   - Infrastructure reruns are symmetric and evidence-based: the endpoint was unreachable before the first model call.\n   - Contaminated runs are excluded from pooled rates.\n   - Hidden tests are not readable by the agent uid.\n   - The scorer logs every replacement.\ncli/test/eval_integrity.test.ts:234:  const kinds = [\"refuse\", \"overloaded\", \"stream_cut\", \"truncate\", \"hanging_test_command\", \"full_disk\", \"context_overflow\", \"malformed_tool_json\", \"sigterm_resume\"];\ncli/test/eval_integrity.test.ts:236:    const runnerClass = [\"hanging_test_command\", \"full_disk\", \"sigterm_resume\"].includes(kind);\ncli/test/eval_integrity.test.ts:239:      : kind === \"hanging_test_command\"\ncli/test/eval_integrity.test.ts:241:        : kind === \"full_disk\"\ncli/test/eval_integrity.test.ts:254:      model: [\"hanging_test_command\", \"full_disk\", \"sigterm_resume\"].includes(kind) ? { faultsInjected: [] } : { faultsInjected: [event] },\ncli/test/eval_integrity.test.ts:255:      t4FaultsInjected: [\"hanging_test_command\", \"full_disk\", \"sigterm_resume\"].includes(kind) ? [event] : [],\ncli/test/eval_integrity.test.ts:367:  assert.match(validateTask({ ...good, tier: \"T4\", t4RunnerFault: \"full_disk\" }, dir).join(), /supported only as sigterm_resume on a T4 task/);\neval/score.mjs:8:const T4_FAULT_CLASSES = [\neval/score.mjs:13:  \"hanging_test_command\",\neval/score.mjs:14:  \"full_disk\",\neval/score.mjs:21:const T4_RUNNER_CLASSES = new Set([\"hanging_test_command\", \"full_disk\", \"sigterm_resume\"]);\neval/score.mjs:148:  if (event.kind === \"hanging_test_command\") return evidence.observedHung === true && evidence.timedOut === true && evidence.containmentCleaned === true;\neval/score.mjs:149:  if (event.kind === \"full_disk\") return evidence.writeFailedWithEnospc === true && Number.isSafeInteger(evidence.storageLimitBytes) && evidence.storageLimitBytes > 0;\neval/score.mjs:156:const faultRows = T4_FAULT_CLASSES.map((kind) => {\neval/score.mjs:176:  requiredClasses: T4_FAULT_CLASSES.length,\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17224-c0fe-79f1-a031-0db884e4ebbb","create_time":1792916438.98486}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
