{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T08:30:19.494Z","ordinal":332235,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a1722e-9b66-7863-b111-810285c6b6d1","call_id":"call_4d7f03abdde74e34a235b9b44f8c61fe","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 5.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"✔ the model proxy forwards requests and counts answers and upstream failures (283.193041ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy authenticates the local run token and replaces it with the upstream credential (40.352125ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy bounds request count and body size (36.474125ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy bounds concurrent inference and cancels upstream work on client abort (58.400896ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy enforces per-request and aggregate requested completion-token ceilings (49.549495ms)\n✔ the evaluation proxy never forwards the local token when the upstream is unauthenticated (15.065998ms)\n✔ infrastructure reruns use one rule for every agent: a crash after the model answered is scored (249.183216ms)\n✔ contaminated runs leave the pass rate, crashes are counted, and reruns are listed (106.652642ms)\n✔ T4 scoring requires all nine classes and five injected runs per class (964.459295ms)\n✔ task validation: pinned repos, one source, and black-box hidden oracle for qualification (32.028872ms)\n✔ T4 fixture evidence is derived from the exact tool transcript and resource boundary (2.575734ms)\n✔ black-box oracle keeps canary expectations outside the candidate process and returns sanitized evidence (488.437272ms)\n✔ a qualification run is refused without a model fingerprint (weights, server build, sampling) (2.227738ms)\n✔ qualification requires frozen request and aggregate output budgets (1.39387ms)\n✔ hidden tests must be unreadable to the agent's own user (3.406475ms)\n✖ qualification runtime mounts cannot overlap the task tree, held-out store, or private validator paths (75.500783ms)\n✔ qualification remains fail-closed without enforced aggregate resource controls (8.214493ms)\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17224-c0fe-79f1-a031-0db884e4ebbb","create_time":1792917019.4942598}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
