{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T08:36:02.407Z","ordinal":332530,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17224-c0fe-79f1-a031-0db884e4ebbb","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016addbf703fcc81a093e559508f0065cd","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"I confirmed the full-suite claim is still active: Kimi’s live test process is running, so I will not start another test. The T4 prototype also has a real trust gap: command output text alone can be faked. I’m checking the runner’s structured execution result and the claim protocol now so I can make receipts derive from the actual tool invocation and runner outcome, then validate once the suite owner releases the lane."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1792917360331,"completed_at_ms":1792917362407}}
